  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.1.q": "Do I have to upload data or type coordinates?",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.1.a": "No. It's enough to search for your village on the map and tap your field — the boundary is detected automatically and can be adjusted by hand if you like. If you have a shapefile (.zip), you can upload that too. No GIS software or spreadsheet is needed.",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.2.q": "How often are satellite images updated?",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.2.a": "Because we use two sources — NASA HLS and Sentinel-2 — on average there's a pass every few days. Cloudy days can stretch this interval in practice, so each scene's cloud percentage is shown and cloud/shadow pixels are excluded from the calculation. As soon as a new scene arrives, the analysis updates itself.",
