  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.5.a": "The AI agronomist advises, the decision is yours — there's a warning about this under every answer. When the model isn't sure it asks a clarifying question and shows what the answer is based on. In serious cases we recommend contacting a lab or agronomist from the catalog.",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.6.q": "Who does my data belong to?",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.6.a": "Your fields, records and reports belong to your organization. No one else sees them — except the people you invite to your team and the share links you create yourself. A share link opens only the short field card and can be revoked anytime.",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.7.q": "What happens after the trial ends?",
  "SEGMENTS.fermer.faq.7.a": "Nothing is deleted. Your fields, records and history stay put; only the free package's limits kick in. You can upgrade or downgrade the package anytime.",
